## Reference only
- astryx (`meta/astryx`, MIT): React and StyleX design system; the site is plain HTML with Tailwind.
- Mika (`wangzan101/mika`, Apache-2.0): Android agent over ADB or wireless debugging. Not on Carlos's phone; Maestro flows cover the test phone.
- unslop (`heydamir/unslop`, CC-BY-4.0): overlaps Hallmark. Pick one: Hallmark.

## Rejected
AutoGPT (its platform is under Polyform Shield, which restricts products that compete). pinchtab (stealth injection conflicts with responsible scanning). `deepseek-ai/dsh-superagent-prototype` (prototype). `storytold/craft-anything` (same publisher as ArtCraft). VERT (FFmpeg already covers media). sand3d (no use case). pixelfx (decorative).

## Not evaluated
- `annonerdrenzy/survivalllm`: repo not found, and the account does not exist. Needs the correct URL from Carlos.
- `interplains/Zero-Breach-Toolkit`: not the CursorQuota app. Needs the intended repo.
